# Mermaid flowchart renders; over the soft limit a placeholder until Render anyway (prompt 007 §3)
write-file d1.tmp.md "# D\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\nA[Start] --> B{Ok?}\nB -->|yes| C[Done]\n```\n\n```mermaid\ntimeline\n  2026 : x\n```\n"
open d1.tmp.md
wait-idle
assert diagrams_cached == 1
open big-flow.md
wait-idle
assert diagrams_cached == 0
click-render "graph TD"
wait-idle
assert diagrams_cached == 1
